231|/***
232| * MARK: workspaceDepsInstalled
233| * @description Whether every workspace package's dependencies resolve from
234| *   its own package directory. Reads each package's dependency names from
235| *   its manifest (dependencies and devDependencies alike) and checks each
236| *   for a landed package.json under that package's node_modules.
237| * @example workspaceDepsInstalled({ root: "/repo" }) => { installed: true, missing: {} }
238| * @param {Object} [opts]
